  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A uniform string of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is suspended from a rigid support. A short wave pulse is introduced at its lowest end. It starts moving up the string. The time taken to reach the support is&nbsp;</p><p>(Take, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Velocity in a string, at a distance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, is given by<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#181;</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>&#181;</mo></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math> <mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> <mrow> <mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><msqrt> <mrow> <mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow> </msqrt> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>20</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>g</mi></msqrt><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br />On integrating, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>"
  }
